<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title></title>
</head>
<body><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 1em;"><span><span>Currently</span><span>, </span><span>several</span> <span>examples</span> <span>can</span> <span>already</span> <span>be</span> <span> found in </span> <span>the</span> <span> Netherlands. Both </span> <span>universities</span> <span> of </span> <span>applied</span> <span>sciences</span> <span>and</span> <span> research </span> <span>universities</span> <span> offer </span> <span>transdisciplinary</span> <span> courses. A few </span> <span>examples</span> <span> of </span> <span>transdisciplinary</span> <span>education</span><span>:</span></span></p><ul style="list-style-type:disc; padding-left:20px; margin:0 0 16px 0;"><li style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 1em;"><span><span>In </span> <span>the</span> <span> minor </span></span> <a href="https://www.avans.nl/international/studying/programmes/act-for-change-together/exchange/introduction" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span><span>Act for Change Together</span></span></a> <span><span> at </span> <span>Avans</span> <span> University of </span> <span>Applied</span> <span> Sciences, </span><span>students</span> <span>from</span> <span>various</span> <span> disciplines </span> <span>collaborate</span> <span>with</span> <span> stakeholders on </span> <span>societal</span> <span> issues </span> <span>related</span> <span>to</span> <span>the</span> <span> new </span> <span>economy</span><span>.</span></span><br></li></ul><ul style="list-style-type:disc; padding-left:20px; margin:0 0 16px 0;"><li style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 1em;"><span><span>At NHL </span> <span>Stenden</span> <span> University of Applied Sciences, students can </span> <span>participate</span> <span> in the </span></span> <a href="https://www.nhlstenden.com/projecten/social-innovation-lab" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span><span>Social Innovation Lab</span></span></a> <span><span> project, </span><span>located</span> <span> in the heart of a neighborhood, where they work directly with residents to apply their practice collaboratively.</span></span><br></li></ul><ul style="list-style-type:disc; padding-left:20px; margin:0 0 16px 0;"><li style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 1em;"><span><span>In </span> <span>the</span> <span>master's</span> <span>insert</span></span> <a href="https://www.utwente.nl/en/education/master/programmes/transdisciplinary-master-insert/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span><span>Shaping Responsible Futures</span></span></a> <span><span> at </span> <span>the</span> <span> University of Twente, </span><span>students</span> <span>work</span> <span>together</span> <span>with</span> <span>municipalities</span><span>, </span><span>NGOs</span><span>, or companies on issues </span> <span>concerning</span> <span>responsible</span> <span>futures</span> <span>and</span> <span>systemic</span> <span> change.</span></span><br></li></ul><ul style="list-style-type:disc; padding-left:20px; margin:0 0 16px 0;"><li style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 1em;"><span>In the elective course </span> <a href="https://placemakingamsterdam.nl/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span><span>Placemaking</span></span></a> <span><span> at the University of Amsterdam, students from </span> <span>different backgrounds</span> <span> engage with </span> <span>local residents</span> <span> and stakeholders to tackle urban challenges and co-create solutions.</span></span></li></ul></body>
</html>